Alright, I finally have an idea for something new in the game, and it's
actually decent (IMHO ;^).

How about potion of Jekyle and Hyde?  Sort of an intrinsic polymorph, only
it affects your alignment after a suitable random interval, continuously
bouncing you back and forth between lawful & chaotic.  Or, alternately,
instead of putting you on a permanent alignment yo-yo (which could get
rather irritating unless there was some way to cure it - perhaps extra
healing ala halucination?), it could convert you to the opposite
alignment for 50-300 turns, then return you to your original alignment.

